{"id":"989eb1cba8862276","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyRawRow.md","title":"PolyRawRow","display":"PolyRawRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyRawRow","parameters":["z1802","z1803","z1804"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyRawRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1802</span><span>z1803</span><span>z1804</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 语法。有序参数：<code>z1802</code>、<code>z1803</code>、<code>z1804</code>。</p>\n<p>显式项：项变量、带注解 λ、应用、类型抽象、类型应用。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyRawRow z1802 z1803 z1804)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists d\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair d t z1804)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat d)\n        (or\n          (exists z1807 (and (@ Nat z1807) (@ TVar z1807 t)))\n          (or\n            (exists z1808\n              (exists z1809\n                (and\n                  (@ TLam z1808 z1809 t)\n                  (and\n                    (@ PolyTy d z1808)\n                    (exists z1812\n                      (exists z1813 (and (in z1812 z1803) (and (@ App z1802 z1812 z1813) (@ Pair d z1809 z1813)))))))))\n            (or\n              (exists z1808\n                (exists z1809\n                  (and\n                    (@ TApp z1808 z1809 t)\n                    (and\n                      (exists z1814\n                        (exists z1815 (and (in z1814 z1803) (and (@ App z1802 z1814 z1815) (@ Pair d z1808 z1815)))))\n                      (exists z1816\n                        (exists z1817 (and (in z1816 z1803) (and (@ App z1802 z1816 z1817) (@ Pair d z1809 z1817)))))))))\n              (or\n                (exists z1808\n                  (exists z1811\n                    (and\n                      (@ FTAbs z1808 t)\n                      (and\n                        (@ Succ d z1811)\n                        (exists z1818\n                          (exists z1819 (and (in z1818 z1803) (and (@ App z1802 z1818 z1819) (@ Pair z1811 z1808 z1819)))))))))\n                (exists z1808\n                  (exists z1809\n                    (and\n                      (@ FTInst z1808 z1809 t)\n                      (and\n                        (exists z1820\n                          (exists z1821 (and (in z1820 z1803) (and (@ App z1802 z1820 z1821) (@ Pair d z1808 z1821)))))\n                        (@ PolyTy d z1809)))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b540c729aaa0e46\" href=\"?note=1b540c729aaa0e46\" title=\"ZFC_FTAbs\">FTAbs</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"acb0218f5d2e90af\" href=\"?note=acb0218f5d2e90af\" title=\"ZFC_FTInst\">FTInst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d8ed31ea0d65b588\" href=\"?note=d8ed31ea0d65b588\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTy\">PolyTy</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyRawRow z1802 z1803 z1804)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTAbs|FTAbs]]；[[ZFC_FTInst|FTInst]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTAbs","status":"resolved","id":"1b540c729aaa0e46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTAbs|FTAbs]]；[[ZFC_FTInst|FTInst]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTInst","status":"resolved","id":"acb0218f5d2e90af","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTAbs|FTAbs]]；[[ZFC_FTInst|FTInst]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"